# Recruitment bonus policy (required reading)

Before editing ambassador recruitment bonuses, payout UI, activation, or recruiter code handling:

1. Read **`docs/RECRUITMENT-BONUS-POLICY.md`** (policy `2026-03-v2`) end-to-end.
2. Implement via `functions/recruitment-bonus-policy.js` + `recruitment-bonus-service.js` — do not reintroduce legacy RD-only 750 override logic.
3. After changes, run:
   - `node scripts/test-recruitment-bonus-policy.js`
   - `node scripts/verify-ambassador-register-flow.mjs`
4. Deploy: `firebase deploy --only functions` plus site deploy for public/admin JS.

Recruiter codes must use hyphen format (`AMB-KONI-8321`); normalize on client and server. Admin approval still gates activation.
